Subject: [PATCH] fix(chat): non tagliare la frase quando parte uno strumento /
 don't cut a sentence when a tool starts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

IT: la riga di attività del tool cancellava la frase a metà parola e il seguito ricominciava da lì. La frase resta, e il pezzo dopo si attacca.

EN: the tool activity line erased a mid-word sentence and the rest came back as a new start. The sentence stays, and the following piece is appended.
---
 packages/adapters/src/executor.ts | 19 ++++++++++-------
 packages/core/src/events.test.ts  | 24 +++++++++++++++++++++
 packages/core/src/events.ts       | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/adapters/src/executor.ts b/packages/adapters/src/executor.ts
